OL,3,ATrump calls for interest rate cut after
OL,4,Ajobs figures raise hike bets
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has called for interest
OL,7,Frates to be cut later this month,
OL,8,Fclaiming higher rates put the US at a
OL,9,F"very unfair disadvantage".
OL,11,FThe president's remarks came as
OL,12,Fstronger-than-expected jobs figures in
OL,13,Fthe US added to growing expectations
OL,14,Fthat rates could be increased, with
OL,15,Finflation still running high and
OL,16,FAmerican households feeling the pinch
OL,17,Fof rising prices.
