OL,3,ATrump calls for interest rate cut after
OL,4,Ajobs figures raise hike bets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of roles added to the
OL,7,Feconomy increased by 162,000 in August,
OL,8,Falmost triple the 56,000 forecast by
OL,9,Fanalysts, driven by a boost in
OL,10,Fhospitality and education hiring.
OL,12,FTrump said the US should have the
OL,13,F"LOWEST RATE of any country in the
OL,14,FWorld".
